{"slug":"ragon-air-gapped-zero-leak-rag-studio","html":"<h2 id=\"why-we-built-ragon-0-air-gapped-rag-without-hallucinations-or-leaks\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Why We Built RagOn: $0 Air-Gapped RAG Without Hallucinations or Leaks</span><a href=\"#why-we-built-ragon-0-air-gapped-rag-without-hallucinations-or-leaks\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><p class=\"text-pretty\">Most production documentation assistants and product Q&amp;A widgets suffer from four compounding failures:</p><ol>\n<li><strong>Unbounded Vector-DB SaaS Tax</strong>: Spinning up external vector stores, embedding pipelines, and frontier LLM calls just to answer verified product or API questions adds recurring cost and cold-start latency.</li>\n<li><strong>Off-Topic Hallucinations</strong>: Naive top-K similarity search returns the closest chunk even when <code>score = 0.12</code>, causing the assistant to invent answers on unrelated queries.</li>\n<li><strong>Cleartext Blocklists Leaked in Client Bundles</strong>: Widgets with offline fallbacks often import regex guardrails into browser chunks—exposing internal project handles, admin usernames, or secret prefixes to anyone inspecting <code>dist/client/assets/*.js</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Landing Page Bundle Bloat</strong>: Statically importing chat UI + corpus payloads into the root layout penalizes First Contentful Paint (FCP) across every marketing route.</li>\n</ol><p class=\"text-pretty\">To share the exact architecture powering Aldeon's assistant as a <strong>100% free open developer product</strong>, we launched <strong>RagOn (<code>rag-on</code>)</strong> at <a href=\"https://aldeon.app/rag-on\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline\"><code>aldeon.app/rag-on</code></a>—our <strong>8th active product</strong>, pairing a live <strong>6-Stage X-Ray Playground</strong>, a <strong>Client-Side Zero-Leak Corpus Auditor</strong>, and a <strong>7-File Cross-Stack Replication Kit</strong> (<code>init-rag-on.mjs</code>).</p><hr /><h2 id=\"the-6-phase-retrieval-grounding-architecture\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>The 6-Phase Retrieval &amp; Grounding Architecture</span><a href=\"#the-6-phase-retrieval-grounding-architecture\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><p class=\"text-pretty\">RagOn runs entirely in memory with <strong><code>0ms</code> disk I/O</strong>, sub-2ms full-corpus ranking, and deterministic refusal whenever evidence falls below threshold:</p><div class=\"code-block relative my-5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm group\">\n<div class=\"code-block-header flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\">\n<span class=\"font-medium\">text</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded transition-colors\" data-code=\"%5BUser%20Query%20(%3C%3D360%20chars)%5D%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%96%BC%20%20Phase%202%3A%20NFD%20Normalization%20%2B%20Hash%2FInjection%20Guardrail%20(%3C0.1ms)%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%9C%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%20(Blocked%3A%20Injection%20%2F%20Secret%20Probe%20%2F%2040%20req%2Fmin%20RL)%20%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%96%BA%20Safe%20Refusal%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%96%BC%20%20Phase%203%3A%20Bilingual%20PT%2FEN%20Scoring%20%26%20Synonym%20Expansion%20(%3C0.2ms)%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%96%BC%20%20Phase%204%3A%20Field-Weighted%20BM25%20%2B%20Character%203-Gram%20Cosine%20(%3C1.2ms)%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%96%BC%20%20Phase%205%3A%20Strict%20Evidence%20Grounding%20Gate%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%20%20(top.score%20%3E%3D%204.2%20%26%26%20strongAnchors%20%3E%3D%201)%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%9C%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%20(Failed)%20%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%96%BA%20Deterministic%20Out-of-Scope%20Refusal%20%2B%20Prompt%20Chips%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%96%BC%20%20Phase%206%3A%20Extractive%20(%240)%20or%20XML-Hardened%20Hybrid%20LLM%20%2B%20Output%20Shield%0A%5BGrounded%20Answer%20%2B%20Verified%20Internal%20%2Froute%20Citations%20%2B%20Cache-Control%3A%20private%2C%20no-store%5D\" data-i18n-aria=\"copyCode\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg><span data-copy-label>Copy</span></button>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark shiki-pre\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[User Query (&lt;=360 chars)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ▼  Phase 2: NFD Normalization + Hash/Injection Guardrail (&lt;0.1ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ├── (Blocked: Injection / Secret Probe / 40 req/min RL) ──► Safe Refusal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ▼  Phase 3: Bilingual PT/EN Scoring &amp; Synonym Expansion (&lt;0.2ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ▼  Phase 4: Field-Weighted BM25 + Character 3-Gram Cosine (&lt;1.2ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ▼  Phase 5: Strict Evidence Grounding Gate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         │  (top.score &gt;= 4.2 &amp;&amp; strongAnchors &gt;= 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ├── (Failed) ──► Deterministic Out-of-Scope Refusal + Prompt Chips</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ▼  Phase 6: Extractive ($0) or XML-Hardened Hybrid LLM + Output Shield</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Grounded Answer + Verified Internal /route Citations + Cache-Control: private, no-store]</span></span></code></pre>\n</div><h3 id=\"phase-1-air-gapped-typed-bilingual-corpus\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Phase 1: Air-Gapped Typed Bilingual Corpus</span><a href=\"#phase-1-air-gapped-typed-bilingual-corpus\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h3><p class=\"text-pretty\">Instead of scraping unpredictable PDFs at runtime, knowledge lives in a versioned, TypeScript/Python-typed array (<code>ragCorpus.ts</code> / <code>rag_corpus.py</code>) containing bilingual EN/PT titles, concise facts, domain keywords, internal-only citations (<code>route.startsWith(\"/\")</code>), and curated follow-up chips. Automated CI tests scan the serialized corpus against 10 Zero-Leak rules before every deploy.</p><h3 id=\"phase-2-nfd-normalization-pre-retrieval-guardrail-sub-01ms\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Phase 2: NFD Normalization &amp; Pre-Retrieval Guardrail (<code>sub-0.1ms</code>)</span><a href=\"#phase-2-nfd-normalization-pre-retrieval-guardrail-sub-01ms\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h3><p class=\"text-pretty\">Queries are capped at <strong>360 characters</strong>, decomposed via Unicode NFD normalization to strip combining marks (<code>[\\u0300-\\u036f]</code>) so accented variations like <code>\"ignorar instruções\"</code> cannot slip past ASCII patterns, and rate-limited at <strong>40 requests / 60s</strong> per IP in a sliding window.</p><h3 id=\"phase-3-bilingual-pten-scoring-domain-synonym-expansion-sub-02ms\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Phase 3: Bilingual PT/EN Scoring &amp; Domain Synonym Expansion (<code>sub-0.2ms</code>)</span><a href=\"#phase-3-bilingual-pten-scoring-domain-synonym-expansion-sub-02ms\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h3><p class=\"text-pretty\">Bilingual engineers routinely mix English UI nouns inside Portuguese sentences (e.g., <em>\"Quais features e pricing o app tem?\"</em>). RagOn weights Portuguese diacritics (<code>+3.5</code>) and function words (<code>+3.0</code>) above English tech loanwords (<code>+1.5</code>) so mixed queries stay in the user's grammatical language, then expands tokens through a curated bilingual synonym table (<code>preco -&gt; pricing, price, cost, pro, free</code>).</p><h3 id=\"phase-4-field-weighted-bm25-character-3-gram-cosine-sub-12ms\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Phase 4: Field-Weighted BM25 + Character 3-Gram Cosine (<code>sub-1.2ms</code>)</span><a href=\"#phase-4-field-weighted-bm25-character-3-gram-cosine-sub-12ms\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h3><p class=\"text-pretty\">At module boot, RagOn pre-indexes corpus tokens and character trigrams once. Each query is scored via:</p><div class=\"code-block relative my-5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm group\">\n<div class=\"code-block-header flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\">\n<span class=\"font-medium\">text</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded transition-colors\" data-code=\"Score%20%3D%20BM25(Title%20*%203.0%20%2B%20Keywords%20*%202.4%20%2B%20Body%20*%201.0%2C%20k1%20%3D%201.4%2C%20b%20%3D%200.65)%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%2B%204.5%20*%20Cosine3Gram(Title%20%2B%20Keywords)%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%2B%204.0%20*%20Cosine3Gram(FullChunk)%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%2B%20ScopeAndCategoryBoosts\" data-i18n-aria=\"copyCode\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg><span data-copy-label>Copy</span></button>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark shiki-pre\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Score = BM25(Title * 3.0 + Keywords * 2.4 + Body * 1.0, k1 = 1.4, b = 0.65)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      + 4.5 * Cosine3Gram(Title + Keywords)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      + 4.0 * Cosine3Gram(FullChunk)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      + ScopeAndCategoryBoosts</span></span></code></pre>\n</div><p class=\"text-pretty\">Combining lexical IDF precision with character 3-gram cosine handles single-character typos (<code>\"precing\"</code>, <code>\"sincroniza\"</code>) without pulling in heavy vector embedding models.</p><h3 id=\"phase-5-strict-evidence-grounding-gate\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Phase 5: Strict Evidence Grounding Gate</span><a href=\"#phase-5-strict-evidence-grounding-gate\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h3><p class=\"text-pretty\">Rather than blindly returning <code>rankedDocs[0]</code>, RagOn enforces a deterministic evidence gate:</p><div class=\"code-block relative my-5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm group\">\n<div class=\"code-block-header flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\">\n<span class=\"font-medium\">typescript</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded transition-colors\" data-code=\"const%20passed%20%3D%0A%20%20top.score%20%3E%3D%204.2%20%26%26%0A%20%20top.strongAnchors%20%3E%3D%201%20%26%26%0A%20%20(hasExplicitScope%20%7C%7C%20(top.matchedConcepts%20%3E%3D%202%20%26%26%20top.score%20%3E%3D%205.5))%3B\" data-i18n-aria=\"copyCode\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg><span data-copy-label>Copy</span></button>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark shiki-pre\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> passed</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  top.score </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&gt;=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4.2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &amp;&amp;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  top.strongAnchors </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&gt;=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &amp;&amp;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (hasExplicitScope </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (top.matchedConcepts </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&gt;=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &amp;&amp;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> top.score </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&gt;=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5.5</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre>\n</div><p class=\"text-pretty\">If evidence falls short, the engine returns a helpful <code>out_of_scope</code> response with clickable suggested prompts—achieving <strong>0% off-topic hallucinations</strong>.</p><h3 id=\"phase-6-0-extractive-synthesis-or-xml-hardened-hybrid-llm\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Phase 6: <code>$0</code> Extractive Synthesis or XML-Hardened Hybrid LLM</span><a href=\"#phase-6-0-extractive-synthesis-or-xml-hardened-hybrid-llm\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h3><p class=\"text-pretty\">By default, RagOn synthesizes answers deterministically from the winning chunks at <strong>$0 inference cost</strong>. When optional LLM phrasing is enabled, only the winning chunks are wrapped inside <code>`&lt;grounded_context&gt;`</code> XML tags with user input escaped via <code>escapePromptXml()</code>, followed by a 10-rule <code>redactChatOutput()</code> shield and strict <code>Cache-Control: private, no-store, max-age=0</code> headers.</p><hr /><h2 id=\"zero-leak-fnv-1a-hashed-guardrails-client-side-corpus-auditor\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Zero-Leak FNV-1a Hashed Guardrails &amp; Client-Side Corpus Auditor</span><a href=\"#zero-leak-fnv-1a-hashed-guardrails-client-side-corpus-auditor\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><p class=\"text-pretty\">A subtle vulnerability in client-capable RAG assistants is putting restricted internal identifiers or developer handles into cleartext regexes inside client-imported guardrail files. RagOn eliminates cleartext literals from public JS bundles by hashing restricted tokens with <strong>FNV-1a 32-bit digests</strong>:</p><div class=\"code-block relative my-5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm group\">\n<div class=\"code-block-header flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\">\n<span class=\"font-medium\">typescript</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded transition-colors\" data-code=\"function%20fnv1a32Hex(input%3A%20string)%3A%20string%20%7B%0A%20%20let%20hash%20%3D%200x811c9dc5%3B%0A%20%20for%20(let%20i%20%3D%200%3B%20i%20%3C%20input.length%3B%20i%2B%2B)%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20hash%20%5E%3D%20input.charCodeAt(i)%3B%0A%20%20%20%20hash%20%3D%20Math.imul(hash%2C%200x01000193)%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20return%20(hash%20%3E%3E%3E%200).toString(16).padStart(8%2C%20%220%22)%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2F%20Public%20bundle%20carries%20only%20one-way%2032-bit%20digests%20%E2%80%94%20zero%20cleartext%20literals%0Aconst%20RESTRICTED_HASHES%20%3D%20new%20Set(%5B%221794d565%22%2C%20%22bf959e2f%22%5D)%3B%0A%0Aexport%20function%20isRestrictedToken(token%3A%20string)%3A%20boolean%20%7B%0A%20%20return%20RESTRICTED_HASHES.has(fnv1a32Hex(token.trim().toLowerCase()))%3B%0A%7D\" data-i18n-aria=\"copyCode\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg><span data-copy-label>Copy</span></button>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark shiki-pre\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fnv1a32Hex</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)<