49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> RESTRICTED_HASHES</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1794d565\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bf959e2f\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isRestrictedToken</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">token</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> RESTRICTED_HASHES</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fnv1a32Hex</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(token.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trim</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toLowerCase</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre>\n</div><p class=\"text-pretty\">On <a href=\"https://aldeon.app/rag-on\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline\"><code>aldeon.app/rag-on</code></a>, engineers can also paste any serialized JSON corpus into the <strong>100% Client-Side Corpus &amp; Citation Security Auditor</strong> to validate schema integrity, flag external non-relative citations, detect leaked key prefixes (<code>AIza</code>, <code>AKIA</code>, <code>sk_live</code>, <code>ghp_</code>, <code>eyJ</code>), and run <strong>1-click Auto-Sanitize</strong> without sending a single byte over the network.</p><hr /><h2 id=\"7-file-cross-stack-starter-kit-init-rag-onmjs\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>7-File Cross-Stack Starter Kit (<code>init-rag-on.mjs</code>)</span><a href=\"#7-file-cross-stack-starter-kit-init-rag-onmjs\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><p class=\"text-pretty\">RagOn packages its entire architecture into a portable <strong>7-file starter kit</strong> generated interactively in the browser or scaffolded via <code>init-rag-on.mjs</code> across five runtimes:</p><ul>\n<li><strong>React 19 + React Router 7 Edge SSR</strong> (<code>TypeScript · Edge Action + Lazy Drawer</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>Next.js App Router</strong> (<code>TypeScript · app/api/chat/route.ts + Client Drawer</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>Node / Bun / Cloudflare Worker (Hono)</strong> (<code>TypeScript · Stateless JSON Microservice</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>Python 3.12 FastAPI + Pydantic v2</strong> (<code>Pure Stdlib Math + FastAPI Router</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>Expo SDK React Native</strong> (<code>Offline Fallback + Modal Sheet</code>)</li>\n</ul><p class=\"text-pretty\">Every generated bundle outputs the exact 7-file contract:</p><ol>\n<li><code>ragCorpus.ts</code> / <code>rag_corpus.py</code> — Typed air-gapped knowledge chunks</li>\n<li><code>chatGuardrails.ts</code> / <code>rag_guardrails.py</code> — NFD normalization, FNV-1a hashed guards &amp; output shield</li>\n<li><code>ragEngine.ts</code> / <code>rag_engine.py</code> — Field-weighted BM25 + 3-gram cosine + grounding gate</li>\n<li><code>api.chat.ts</code> / <code>route.ts</code> / <code>routers/chat.py</code> — Rate-limited endpoint (<code>Cache-Control: private, no-store</code>)</li>\n<li><code>RagChatDrawer.tsx</code> / <code>RagChatSheet.tsx</code> — <code>React.lazy()</code> drawer (<code>0 KB</code> initial paint impact)</li>\n<li><code>rag-security.test.ts</code> / <code>test_rag_security.py</code> — Automated CI zero-leak &amp; grounding suite</li>\n<li><code>.agents/skills/rag-on/SKILL.md</code> — Agent skill instructions compatible with <a href=\"/blog/on-memory-deterministic-ai-engineering-governance\" class=\"font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline\"><code>MemOn</code></a></li>\n</ol><hr /><h2 id=\"production-anti-patterns-registry-ap-rag-01-to-ap-rag-08\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Production Anti-Patterns Registry (<code>AP-RAG-01</code> to <code>AP-RAG-08</code>)</span><a href=\"#production-anti-patterns-registry-ap-rag-01-to-ap-rag-08\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><p class=\"text-pretty\">RagOn ships an interactive <strong>5-field Anti-Pattern Registry</strong> documenting real production failure modes encountered across Edge SSR, mobile, and serverless deployments:</p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Code</th>\n<th>Domain</th>\n<th>Anti-Pattern Eliminated</th>\n<th>Verified Solution</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>AP-RAG-01</code></td>\n<td>Security</td>\n<td>Cleartext internal blocklist literals in client JS</td>\n<td>Structural regexes + 32-bit FNV-1a token hashes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AP-RAG-02</code></td>\n<td>Security</td>\n<td>Accented Unicode bypassing ASCII guardrails</td>\n<td>NFD decomposition + diacritic stripping before checks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AP-RAG-03</code></td>\n<td>Retrieval</td>\n<td>Pure exact-word matching failing on typos</td>\n<td>Field-weighted BM25 + character 3-gram cosine + synonyms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AP-RAG-04</code></td>\n<td>Grounding</td>\n<td>Returning <code>rankedDocs[0]</code> unconditionally</td>\n<td>Strict threshold gate (<code>score &gt;= 4.2</code>, <code>strongAnchors &gt;= 1</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AP-RAG-05</code></td>\n<td>Edge SSR</td>\n<td>Eagerly importing corpus &amp; chat drawer in root</td>\n<td>Mount lightweight trigger + <code>React.lazy()</code> drawer on open</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AP-RAG-06</code></td>\n<td>Edge SSR</td>\n<td>Public CDN caching on dynamic <code>POST /api/chat</code></td>\n<td><code>Cache-Control: private, no-store, max-age=0</code> on all statuses</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AP-RAG-07</code></td>\n<td>Bilingual</td>\n<td>English UI loanwords flipping PT-BR replies</td>\n<td>Higher weights for PT function words &amp; diacritics</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AP-RAG-08</code></td>\n<td>LLM Safety</td>\n<td>Unescaped user queries in hybrid LLM prompts</td>\n<td><code>`&lt;grounded_context&gt;`</code> XML tags + <code>escapePromptXml()</code> + output shield</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><hr /><h2 id=\"production-outcomes-ecosystem-links\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Production Outcomes &amp; Ecosystem Links</span><a href=\"#production-outcomes-ecosystem-links\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><ul>\n<li><strong><code>$0 / Free</code> Default Inference</strong>: Deterministic extractive synthesis resolves documentation and support queries with zero external LLM API calls.</li>\n<li><strong><code>sub-2ms</code> End-to-End Retrieval</strong>: Pre-indexed BM25 + 3-gram scoring finishes in under 2 milliseconds per request.</li>\n<li><strong><code>0%</code> CI Secret Leakage &amp; <code>0 KB</code> Initial Paint Tax</strong>: Automated <code>rag-on-security.test.ts</code> gates combined with <code>React.lazy()</code> mounting keep landing pages fast and air-gapped.</li>\n</ul><p class=\"text-pretty\">Explore the live X-Ray Playground, Corpus Auditor, and Starter Kit at <a href=\"https://aldeon.app/rag-on\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline\"><strong>aldeon.app/rag-on</strong></a>, pair it with <a href=\"/blog/on-memory-deterministic-ai-engineering-governance\" class=\"font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline\"><strong>MemOn (<code>sub-20KB</code> agent governance)</strong></a>, or follow the hands-on curriculum in <a href=\"/academy/private-rag-onmemory-agent-governance\" class=\"font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline\"><strong>Academy Track 1: RagOn &amp; MemOn</strong></a>.</p>"}
